5
00:00:08.088 --> 00:00:08.921
(Ross chuckling)

6
00:00:08.921 --> 00:00:09.754
And with me at the desk,

7
00:00:09.754 --> 00:00:12.440
my trusty co-pilot, Rossi Ross Matthews.

8
00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.770
Nom-nom-nom-nom-nom-nom. Hi everybody!

9
00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:15.300
Hi!
(audience cheering)

10
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.021
Corn on the cob. Ooh.

11
00:00:17.021 --> 00:00:18.426
(audience cheering)

12
00:00:18.426 --> 00:00:19.460
Stick around to the end of the show,

13
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:21.530
