14
00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:22.680
My favorite day.

15
00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.507
Pop quiz.
Yes!

16
00:00:24.507 --> 00:00:25.842
(school bell ringing)
(audience cheering)

17
00:00:25.842 --> 00:00:26.740
That's right.

18
