So you have to pay attention to everything.

26
00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:46.550
I always play along.

27
00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:47.383
Oh, me too,

28
00:00:47.383 --> 00:00:48.627
and I'm always proud of myself
Me too.

29
00:00:48.627 --> 00:00:49.531
