30
00:00:49.531 --> 00:00:50.770
(Drew laughing)
(Ross laughing)

31
00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:52.150
All right, well, first up,

32
00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:54.510
this story really speaks to me,

33
00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:56.760
and I'm excited to tell you about it.

34
00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.540
So the Oscars are a month away,

35
00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:02.790
