39
00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:13.193
That's right.

40
00:01:13.193 --> 00:01:14.460
You can vote on Twitter
(audience cheering)

41
00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:19.047
or the Oscars website until March 3rd,

42
00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:22.090 line:15%
