44
00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:29.440 line:15%
Results will be announced live, on the stage, on the Oscars.

45
00:01:29.482 --> 00:01:30.315 line:15%
(Drew exhaling)

46
00:01:30.315 --> 00:01:32.430 line:15%
I don't even know where to unpack this bag,

47
00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:36.480 line:15%
