51
00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:47.470 line:15%
Fan participation is a wonderful thing.

52
00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:50.300 line:15%
I am so excited about this.

53
00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.140 line:15%
Me too. Listen, I love the Oscars.

54
00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:54.550 line:15%
It is my New Year's, my Christmas, everything.

55
00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:55.550 line:15%
I love the Oscars,

56
00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:58.070
but there are some years when what's voted on as the best,

57
00:01:58.070 --> 00:02:00.590
doesn't really reflect what audiences are gonna go see.

58
00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:01.520
So I'm on board.

59
00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:04.080
I mean, girl, can I get a time machine, go back to 1989,

60
00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:05.300
