(audience cheering)

62
00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:08.770
Because that-
(audience cheering)

63
00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:10.040
Drink your juice, Shelby.

64
00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.761
Don't talk about me like I'm not here!

65
00:02:11.761 --> 00:02:12.860
Juice is better.

66
00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:13.920
(Ross laughing)

67
00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:16.100
Yes.
I agree.

68
00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:19.310
I also think, in this new modern era,

69
00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:22.390
