70
00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:24.033
Let's get the fans in there.
Absolutely.

71
00:02:24.033 --> 00:02:25.760
And it's a way to honor,

72
00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:28.000
like for example, this year "Spider-Man",

73
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.020
you know there was a lot of,

74
00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:29.853
did you guys see,

75
00:02:29.853 --> 00:02:31.415
I mean everybody on the planet saw "Spider-Man".

76
00:02:31.415 --> 00:02:32.570
(audience cheering)

77
00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:33.403
There was a lot of buzz

78
00:02:33.403 --> 00:02:34.420
