83
00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:43.280
Don't you think? For this fan voted award?

84
00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:46.020
I feel like it might get my vote, for sure.

85
00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:46.970
Oh, that's a good question.

86
00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:49.350
Is Drew Barrymore gonna go to Twitter and vote?

87
00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:50.700
I absolutely am.

88
00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:53.860
I love the Oscars, but I always felt like

89
00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:58.860
