91
00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.580
Yeah, I think they finally figured it out. 94 years.

92
00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:04.860
Hi, great job. Thanks, Oscars.

93
00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:07.830
Sticking it out.
So, the results

94
00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.150
